#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Export to OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"
msgstr "Eksportowanie do OpenQASM 3 {#export-to-openqasm-3}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can export Qiskit code to OpenQASM 3 with `dumps()`, which exports to a "
"string, or `dump()`, which exports to a file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod Qiskit możesz wyeksportować do OpenQASM 3 za pomocą `dumps()`, które "
"eksportuje do ciągu znaków, lub `dump()`, które eksportuje do pliku.\n"

